WEBVTT

NOTE Transcribed and translated in Translator (first 30s). Not YouTube automatic captions.

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:04.480
The other day I was in Mexico for a few weeks and I had an amazing time.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.739
I love traveling, but when you travel there's one thing that's maybe the worst: mosquitoes.

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:17.719
And then there's the whole Internet issue, meaning going to a country where you don't have roaming and you can't use the Internet anywhere until

00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:21.199
you find Wi‑Fi, because otherwise they bleed you dry with charges.

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:29.260
So today I've brought a sponsor that has an amazing product that I've used, and this is no joke, even outside of sponsored campaigns, which

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.000
is called Saily.
